{"ref":"BDB, עֲשִׂירִי","hw":"עֲשִׂירִי","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשִׂירִי</span></big><sub>20</sub>  <strong>m.</strong>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשִׂירִיָּה</span>, and <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשִׂירִית</span><sub>8</sub> <strong>f. adj. num. ord. tenth</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹר עֲשִׂירִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.3\">Dt 23:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.4\">4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּיּוֹם הָע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:66\" href=\"/Numbers.7.66\">Nu 7:66</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֹדֶשׁ הָע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:5\" href=\"/Genesis.8.5\">Gn 8:5</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.1\">Ez 24:1</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּחֹדֶשׁ הָעֲשִׂרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 39:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.39.1\">Je 39:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> om. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעֲשִׂירִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:5\" href=\"/Genesis.8.5\">Gn 8:5</a> (P), <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּעֲשִׂרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.1\">Ez 29:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.21\">33:21</a>; other nouns om. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעֲשִׂירִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.13\">1 Ch 12:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.17\">25:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.13\">27:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעֲשִׂרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.11\">24:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּשָּׁנָה הָעֲשִׂרִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.1\">Ez 29:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּשּׁ׳ הָעֲשִׂרִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.1\">Je 32:1</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  as subst. <em>a tenth part:</em> f. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשִׂרִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 6:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.6.13\">Is 6:13</a>; f. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשִׂירִית הָאֵיפָ